## 🚀 5. Example Implementation Skeleton (Python)

```python
from langchain.agents import initialize_agent, AgentType
from langchain.llms import OpenAI
from langchain.tools import PythonREPLTool, HumanInputRun

llm = OpenAI(model="gpt-5", temperature=0.2)

tools = [
    PythonREPLTool(),
    HumanInputRun()  # allows clarification with user
]

agent = initialize_agent(
    tools,
    llm,
    agent_type=AgentType.CONVERSATIONAL_REACT_DESCRIPTION,
    verbose=True
)

agent.run("Generate a Python Flask app that serves a to-do list API with SQLite backend.")
```

You can extend this into a **multi-agent system** using [LangGraph](https://www.langchain.com/langgraph), [CrewAI](https://www.crewai.io/), or [OpenDevin](https://github.com/OpenDevin/OpenDevin).

