### **C. Multi-Agent System (CrewAI / LangGraph)**

Implements an *agentic orchestration layer*. Each agent handles a stage of the software generation lifecycle.

| Agent            | Role                 | Description                                         |
| ---------------- | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |
| 🧭 Planner       | Requirement analysis | Converts user input into actionable tasks           |
| 🧩 Architect     | Design               | Defines architecture, file structure, dependencies  |
