| 🧪 Tester        | Validation           | Writes and runs tests, reports results              |
| 🔁 Refiner       | Iteration            | Analyzes errors, improves outputs                   |
| 🗂️ Memory Agent | Context              | Manages embeddings, retrieves relevant project data |

